      "side": 1,
      "message": "Following up from an email convo, I\u0027d suggest advertising `--tune\u003diq` and Variance Boost:\n\n```\n  tune\u003diq, which stands for Image Quality, is a new tuning mode that\n  increases image quality by using the SSIMULACRA 2 metric as a guidance\n  and validating with subjective visual quality checks.\n\n  Variance Boost is a variance AQ implementation that modulates qindex\n  depending on the ratio of low-variance to high-variance 8x8 subblocks\n  within a 64x64 superblock, as well as the actual variance of the\n  subblocks themselves.\n```\n\nWan-Teh: let me know if this is good enough for the release notes, or you need something a bit shorter.",
